<view class="wrap"><view class="title">我的美食护照</view><view class="cover-stage"><view class="passport-cover" bindtap="flip"><view class="gold-rule"/><view class="publisher">全球美食护照</view><view class="micro">GLOBAL DINING PASSPORT</view><view class="emblem">✧</view><view class="passport-title">美食护照</view><view class="micro">DINING · TRAVEL · MEMORIES</view><view class="cover-bottom">{{opened ? '点击合上护照' : '点击打开护照'}}</view></view></view><view class="paper" wx:if="{{opened}}"><view class="micro">PERSONAL DINING DOCUMENT</view><view class="title">我的美食旅程</view><view class="sub">{{beenCount}} 家餐厅 · {{cities}} 座城市 · {{countries}} 个国家与地区</view><view class="stamp-grid"><view class="stamp" wx:for="{{stamps}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="micro">DINING VISA</view><view>{{item.city}}</view><view class="stamp-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="micro">{{item.date || '已到访'}} · {{item.score ? item.score + ' / 5' : '未评分'}}</view></view></view><view class="sub" wx:if="{{!stamps.length}}">在餐厅详情标记「去过」，留下第一枚签章。</view><view class="machine">DINING&lt;&lt;PASSPORT&lt;&lt;PERSONAL&lt;&lt;JOURNEY</view></view><view class="card"><view>旅行美食地图</view><input class="field" placeholder="新旅行名称，例如：巴黎秋日旅行" value="{{name}}" bindinput="typeName"/><button class="btn" bindtap="create">创建旅行</button><view wx:for="{{trips}}" wx:key="id" class="row"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.ids.length}} 家</text><text class="muted">旅行清单</text></view></view><view class="card"><view>想去 · {{wantCount}} 家</view><view>去过 · {{beenCount}} 家</view><view class="sub">记录保存在当前设备。跨设备与网站账户同步尚未接入。</view></view></view><view class="wrap"><view class="title">想去清单</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{wants}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open">{{item.name}}<view class="sub">{{item.city}} · {{item.rating}}</view></view></view>